                                "sense_id": "a756d307-27ed-3c18-9ea7-bd1dd2a3b0d5",
                                "text": "Si le cor du déjeuner avait sonné à ce moment-là, elle ne l'aurait pas entendu, à cause du walkman.",
                                "translation": "If the lunch horn had sounded just then, she wouldn't have heard it, because of the walkman.",
